window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Mina Wilde—bookstore owner, girlfriend to three of the hottest heroes of literature, and now . . . reluctant vampire hunter.</p> <p>In the sixth novel in the Nevermore Bookshop Mysteries, Mina, Heathcliff, Morrie, and Quoth face off against their ultimate enemy.</p> <p>Add meddling villagers, an army of fictional characters to wrangle, Mina's mother's latest get-rich-quick scheme, and a curious dog into the mix, and Mina's got her hands full.</p> <p>But Nevermore Bookshop still has secrets to reveal. Mina and her men are ready for an epic showdown worthy of a Homeric poem . . . if they survive.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
